Task 6 — Human Verification (blocking gate)

  Prerequisites: pnpm start:dev running, valid Auth0 JWT, at least one PUBLISHED event in DB.

  1. RSVP-01 — Upsert semantics
  POST /api/v1/events/{eventId}/rsvp   { "state": "INTERESTED" }
  → 201 { id, state: "INTERESTED", rsvpedAt }

  POST again:  { "state": "GOING" }
  → 201, same id, same rsvpedAt, state: "GOING"

  2. RSVP-03 — Counts on event detail
  GET /api/v1/events/{eventId}
  → includes "interestedCount": 0, "goingCount": 1

  3. RSVP-04 — History
  GET /api/v1/me/rsvps
  → 200 { data: [{ rsvpState, rsvpedAt, event: {...} }], nextCursor: null, hasMore: false }

  4. RSVP-02 — Cancel
  DELETE /api/v1/events/{eventId}/rsvp  → 204
  GET /api/v1/me/rsvps                  → empty data []
  GET /api/v1/events/{eventId}          → counts both 0

  5. Re-RSVP after cancel
  POST /api/v1/events/{eventId}/rsvp   { "state": "INTERESTED" }
  → 201, same row id as original (upsert, not new row)

  6. Guard on non-PUBLISHED event
  POST /api/v1/events/{draftEventId}/rsvp
  → 422 (or 404 if not found)

  7. Swagger
  http://localhost:3000/api/docs
  → RSVP endpoints under "Events" + "Me" tags

  ---